    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 16
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>Harvesters are large flying predator creatures native to worlds including Tuchanka, roughly a third the size of a Thresher Maw. During the Reaper invasion in Mass Effect 3, many were corrupted and repurposed as troop transports and atmospheric combat craft.</p><p>In combat they are armed with powerful head-mounted heavy cannons and can deploy other Reaper forces, making them both a direct threat and a force multiplier that demands immediate attention.</p>",
